    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079150/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1713257830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079150/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1713257830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079150/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1713257830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Discover a twisted world in <strong>Not Involved: Vermillion</strong><br><br><strong>Not Involved. Vermillion</strong> is a dark-fantasy story-driven action-adventure game with a craft system.<br><br>Embark on a dark-fantasy journey filled with intrigue, danger, and a touch of madness. Immerse yourself in the captivating story of Doctor, a brilliant mind exiled from the prestigious Academy. In this rotten world teeming with hatred and sorrow, your determination and cunning are all you have to rely on.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>DIAGNOSE PATIENTS<br><br>Carefully listen to the patients' desperate pleas, unravel their mysterious ailments, and meticulously record their symptoms in your journal. Every word could hold the key to their salvation.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079150/extras/86dc1c2fdaa86bcde36f942b99b2ae1d.poster.avif?t=1713257830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079150/extras/86dc1c2fdaa86bcde36f942b99b2ae1d.webm?t=1713257830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079150/extras/86dc1c2fdaa86bcde36f942b99b2ae1d.mp4?t=1713257830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>COLLECT INGREDIENTS<br><br>Venture into the treacherous woods, home to vile monsters eager to claim your life. Amidst the looming danger, there's little time to appreciate the beauty of nature. Collect vital ingredients to unlock the secrets of ancient remedies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079150/extras/81ea169bc4f8ac4073aab103ba6136dd.poster.avif?t=1713257830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079150/extras/81ea169bc4f8ac4073aab103ba6136dd.webm?t=1713257830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079150/extras/81ea169bc4f8ac4073aab103ba6136dd.mp4?t=1713257830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>CRAFT MEDICINES<br><br>Harness your expertise and embark on a series of engaging mini-games to skillfully process each ingredient. Be warned: one wrong move could turn a lifesaving potion into a disastrous concoction.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079150/extras/7e21a95567d93a3b03f97752c5b7b625.poster.avif?t=1713257830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079150/extras/7e21a95567d93a3b03f97752c5b7b625.webm?t=1713257830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079150/extras/7e21a95567d93a3b03f97752c5b7b625.mp4?t=1713257830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>EXPLORE<br><br>Uncover the chilling truth behind the Herbalist's enigmatic disappearance. Delve deep into the haunting unknown as you unravel the dark secrets that haunt these forsaken souls.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079150/extras/34e8382ce5530414ef9ec2bf6bdfe774.poster.avif?t=1713257830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079150/extras/34e8382ce5530414ef9ec2bf6bdfe774.webm?t=1713257830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079150/extras/34e8382ce5530414ef9ec2bf6bdfe774.mp4?t=1713257830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul><br>Prepare to immerse yourself in the captivating world of <strong>Not Involved: Vermillion</strong>, where lust for life, cunning, and an unyielding spirit are your only allies. Will you triumph against the odds and reshape the destiny of this twisted realm?<br><br>Add <strong>Not Involved. Vermillion</strong> to your Wishlist now!",
